Description: Launches locally the Senior-IPI web app. Senior-IPI The Senior International Prognostic Index (Senior-IPI) is a prognostic tool designed specifically for elderly patients (≥80 years of age) with large B-cell lymphoma (LBCL). See Dubois & al. (20026,<doi:10.1111/bjh.70784>), for details.
